# Phase 03 — generator smoke tests, σ/BR closure, Delphes validation, condor test jobs (WH, multi_r1)

Date UTC: 2026-11-03/04 (revised pre-G2). **Status: IN-PROGRESS — Phase 03 becomes PASS only when every sample type has a verified test job.** Interactive validation (σ, BR/WF closure, Delphes objects, gridpack/PY8/LHE σ consistency) is PASS. Test-job coverage: the 9 finished earlier (S_EW_WHjj, H_ttH_1l, H_QCD_WH_mlm, F_Wjj_pilot, F_Wajj_pilot, F_QCD_Wajj_nomjj, B_QCD_Waajj_vbs, B_QCD_Waajj_nomjj + the held B_EW_Waajj_vbs, cluster 884457.3 waiting for gridpack 884456.3) plus the 21 G2 test jobs of cluster **884935** (all types: S_EW_WHjj_taunu, H_QCD_WHjj_fixed, I_WHjj, H_tHq_lep, H_tHW_1l, T_tta_1l, T_ttaa_1l, T_tWa_1l, T_tt_1l, T_ttjj_1l, F_Wjjjj, F_EW_Wajj_vbs, F_QCD_Wajj_vbs, F_EW_Wajj_nomjj, B_EW_Waajj_nomjj, V_WZa_WH, V_WWa_WH, V_ZZa_WH, and the three D-WH-3 top-ups H_ggZH_wh, H_ttH_dilep_wh, H_ZH_tautau_wh), gridpacks in cluster **884934** (16). The live per-sample status and the finished-job table (table in §5, regenerated by `scripts/audit_test_jobs.py`) are authoritative; the per-sample table with cluster IDs is `04_production_plan.md`. No duplicates: `condor_q` checked before every submission.
Stack, versions, model, PDFs: as Phase 01 (LCG_110, MG5 3.6.3 upstream, Pythia 8.317 CP5, Delphes 3.5.1 slim CMS card, NNPDF31_nnlo_as_0118). Seeds: **G1 revision (D-WH-1, SPEC 3.4): seed = 2 000 000 + 100 000·R + 1000·idx + J, R = 1 (multi_r1)**, J = 100 gridpack, 101 test job, 110-119 twin jobs, ≥ 200 production jobs (`scripts/seeds.py`, `config/sample_registry.yaml`). Seeds already used under the OLD formula (R = 11: smoke 2110001-2110099 reserved, gridpacks/test jobs 2111000-2130001) are kept unchanged in `config/seeds_used_preG1.txt`; the old→new mapping is `config/seed_mapping_old_to_new.txt`; the uniqueness assertion (`seeds.check`) covers both sets and runs in `scripts/make_condor_g2.py` (47 G2 seeds, `config/seeds_g2.txt`).

## 1. Smoke tests: σ (all interactive, ≤ 12 min wall, 4 cores, no bulk)
All cards in `cards/smoke/` (`scripts/make_smoke_cards.sh`, `scripts/make_prod_cards.sh`), runner `scripts/mg5_run_smoke.sh` (patch 000), logs/banners/LHE under `work/smoke/<card>/`. Gen cuts: WH/ZH-like jets pT>20, |η|<5, ΔR(jj)>0.4, `cut_decays=False`; photons as listed in the YAML. LO MG5 σ in fb with the integration error:
@@SMOKE@@
Reading the table: σ(W⁺Hjj EW light) = 38.40, W⁻ = 23.65 fb; b-inclusive and `/ t t~` variants: Phase 01 §3 (gauge-invariance evidence). Q_aa_0j/Q_aajj are used for the non-prompt-lepton bound (Phase 02 §5). `H_QCD_WH_mlm_smoke` (862 fb) is the *pre-matching* sum and is not a physical σ (matched: 302.3 ± 5.3 fb, §4).

